AUDIO: 'a comparison video here in the near future, but as a sneak peek of one of the many reasons, for example, if I wanted to do a corner, which most homes will have many of these, on Permatrack, it\'s this simple and something I can easily do while up on a ladder.'

[04:03] [scene:talk]
