AUDIO: 'For a metal track, and I\'ve watched a lot of videos on this, you mark your spot, you get out your hacksaw, and start cutting away. And honestly, after 3 seconds of doing this, I would say it\'s borderline 100% necessary to get a miter saw with a good metal blade'

